{"id":"nytimes","name":"纽约时报","type":"中文网","total":20,"updatedTime":1793677530844,"items":[{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261103/chinas-message-to-its-rivals-you-need-what-we-make/","title":"中国技术出口管制升级：利用工业优势构建经济武器库","desc":"北京近期实施多项技术出口管制措施，旨在限制其他国家在工业与技术领域与中国制造商竞争的能力。很多国家对中国的举措感到担忧，正努力降低这种依赖。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/02/multimedia/02int-china-export-controls-01-pqvb/02int-china-export-controls-01-pqvb-articleLarge.jpg' alt='一台盾构机正在中国一家工厂组装。北京近期采取行动，管制数十项技术的出口，其中包括这类机器。 CHINATOPIX, via Associated Press'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>CHINATOPIX, via Associated Press</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>一台盾构机正在中国一家工厂组装。北京近期采取行动，管制数十项技术的出口，其中包括这类机器。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-11-03 11:29","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261103/chinas-message-to-its-rivals-you-need-what-we-make/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261103/chinas-message-to-its-rivals-you-need-what-we-make/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/business/20261103/malaysia-data-center-china/","title":"全球人工智能热潮中的“黑马”：马来西亚","desc":"得益于廉价土地和电力以及海底互联网电缆，中美科技巨头正向马来西亚投入数十亿美元，建设庞大的数据中心。马来西亚在中美AI竞争中没有选边站，而是对双方都敞开大门。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/30/multimedia/Biz-Malaysia-Video-Still-bvqt/Biz-Malaysia-Video-Still-bvqt-articleLarge.jpg' alt=' Ulet Ifansasti for The New York Times'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Ulet Ifansasti for The New York Times</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'></p>","author":null,"time":"2026-11-03 11:00","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/business/20261103/malaysia-data-center-china/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/business/20261103/malaysia-data-center-china/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261103/midterms-election-2026-senate-house-congress/","title":"一文读懂美国中期选举：两党各持何种立场，选情如何","desc":"受到伊朗战争和不断上涨的物价影响，特朗普支持率接近历史最低水平。这让民主党人燃起希望，他们有机会赢得目前由共和党控制的众议院。参议院选情则更为复杂。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/02/multimedia/02pol-midterms-explainer-01-mcjg/02pol-midterms-explainer-01-mcjg-articleLarge.jpg' alt='周五，迈阿密选举总部进行的提前投票。 Ruth Fremson/The New York Times'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Ruth Fremson/The New York Times</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>周五，迈阿密选举总部进行的提前投票。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-11-03 10:15","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261103/midterms-election-2026-senate-house-congress/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261103/midterms-election-2026-senate-house-congress/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/opinion/20261103/us-china-ai-manufacturing-exports-weapons/","title":"人工智能时代，美中关系将迎来重大变革","desc":"此次中国之行让我清楚地看到，人工智能已经在重塑美中关系。它正在地缘政治层面拉近两国的距离，与此同时也加剧了双方的贸易分歧。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/02/opinion/02friedman-image/02friedman-image-articleLarge.png' alt=' Jason Allen Lee'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Jason Allen Lee</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'></p>","author":null,"time":"2026-11-03 07:27","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/opinion/20261103/us-china-ai-manufacturing-exports-weapons/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/opinion/20261103/us-china-ai-manufacturing-exports-weapons/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261102/china-tiananmen-kristof/","title":"在天安门屠杀现场，我目睹了中国人民非凡的勇气","desc":"这也许是我生涯中报道过的最重要的新闻，也是我最悲伤的时刻。那个夜晚，我亲眼目睹了中国工人和农民非凡的勇气，他们或许说不清民主的定义，却愿意为民主献出生命。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/09/01/multimedia/00PROJECTS-175-EYEWITNESS-TIANANMEN-SQUARE-vfhm/00PROJECTS-175-EYEWITNESS-TIANANMEN-SQUARE-vfhm-videoLarge.jpg' alt=' Peter Turnley/Getty Images. Illustration by Matt Dorfman'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Peter Turnley/Getty Images. Illustration by Matt Dorfman</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'></p>","author":null,"time":"2026-11-02 02:20","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261102/china-tiananmen-kristof/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261102/china-tiananmen-kristof/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261102/trump-speeches-rallies-age/","title":"失言、发怒、关注“屁股”：特朗普的言论变得更粗俗","desc":"时报借助AI查验了特朗普在演讲、集会、社交媒体、采访和公开会议中的言论，发现他的的公共表达比十年前更粗俗、更无所顾忌、更缺乏连贯性。白宫否认特朗普精力衰退。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/30/multimedia/30DC-TRUMP-AGE-TOP-04-fzmt/30DC-TRUMP-AGE-TOP-04-fzmt-articleLarge.jpg' alt=' Alex Kent/The New York Times'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Alex Kent/The New York Times</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'></p>","author":null,"time":"2026-11-02 01:16","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261102/trump-speeches-rallies-age/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261102/trump-speeches-rallies-age/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/technology/20261102/binance-hack-crypto-north-korea/","title":"币安63亿美元黑客攻击事件始末","desc":"币安被迫暂停充值和提现，承诺承担所有损失；其创始人赵长鹏在X上“直播”了事件进展。币安遭受攻击的影响波及整个加密货币行业，执法机构也介入调查。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/01/business/00biz-binance-ticktock/00biz-binance-ticktock-articleLarge.jpg' alt='全球最大加密货币交易所币安表示，这起被业内称为史上最大规模加密货币黑客攻击的事件涉及约63亿美元资金。 SeongJoon Cho/Bloomberg'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>SeongJoon Cho/Bloomberg</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>全球最大加密货币交易所币安表示，这起被业内称为史上最大规模加密货币黑客攻击的事件涉及约63亿美元资金。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-11-02 11:45","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/technology/20261102/binance-hack-crypto-north-korea/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/technology/20261102/binance-hack-crypto-north-korea/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/obits/20261102/liu-yandong-dead/","title":"中国前副总理刘延东去世：跻身共产党高层的少数女性之一","desc":"刘延东出身中共高官家庭，曾任国务院副总理。她是迄今为止中共中央政治局仅有过的六位女性之一，但其职业生涯也凸显了中国统治精英阶层中女性所面临的局限。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/31/multimedia/31obit-liu-02-wcfq/31obit-liu-02-wcfq-articleLarge.jpg' alt='中国前副总理、曾任该国最高级别女官员之一的刘延东于上周三在北京逝世。 Stanley Chou/Getty Images'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Stanley Chou/Getty Images</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>中国前副总理、曾任该国最高级别女官员之一的刘延东于上周三在北京逝世。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-11-02 10:27","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/obits/20261102/liu-yandong-dead/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/obits/20261102/liu-yandong-dead/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261102/mosquito-laser-ai/","title":"中国企业推出人工智能灭蚊设备","desc":"一家中国公司推出AI激光灭蚊设备，利用自动驾驶汽车所采用的技术锁定目标，同时依靠人工智能判断何时可以安全发射激光。设备售价1000美元，预计几周内量产。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/19/arts/rv-ai-mosquitos-final-v3/rv-ai-mosquitos-final-v3-videoLarge.jpg' alt=' Qilai Shen for The New York Times'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Qilai Shen for The New York Times</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'></p>","author":null,"time":"2026-11-02 09:56","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261102/mosquito-laser-ai/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261102/mosquito-laser-ai/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/asia-pacific/20261102/japan-vivant-spy-show-china/","title":"日剧《Vivant》被指“辱华”，三丽鸥取消联名合作","desc":"北京指责这部剧集将虚构的中国情报机构设为反派，“企图通过文化产品抹黑中国、散播仇华情绪”。三丽鸥宣布取消与该剧的商品联名合作，中国是三丽鸥增长最快的市场之一。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/30/multimedia/30int-japan-spy-thriller-gwhz/30int-japan-spy-thriller-gwhz-articleLarge.jpg' alt='北京方面称，热门日本剧集《别班》宣扬对华负面看法。 Andy Wong/Associated Press'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Andy Wong/Associated Press</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>北京方面称，热门日本剧集《别班》宣扬对华负面看法。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-11-02 09:53","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/asia-pacific/20261102/japan-vivant-spy-show-china/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/asia-pacific/20261102/japan-vivant-spy-show-china/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/business/20261026/changpeng-zhao-binance/","title":"探访加密货币大佬赵长鹏：亿万富翁天堂里的前罪犯","desc":"赵长鹏曾因金融犯罪入狱，后被特朗普赦免，如今在阿联酋过着奢华的生活，仍是加密货币行业的权势人物。在一个肆无忌惮地打破规则却能获得奖励的时代，他堪称常胜赢家。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/01/multimedia/01biz-sun-cz-promo-fvwz/01biz-sun-cz-promo-fvwz-videoLarge.jpg' alt='币安创始人赵长鹏承认违反反洗钱法，并于去年10月获得特朗普总统的赦免。 Laura Boushnak for The New York Times'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Laura Boushnak for The New York Times</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>币安创始人赵长鹏承认违反反洗钱法，并于去年10月获得特朗普总统的赦免。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-10-30 02:00","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/business/20261026/changpeng-zhao-binance/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/business/20261026/changpeng-zhao-binance/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/climate/20261030/glass-skyscrapers-heat-climate-change/","title":"玻璃摩天大楼：壮丽的城市天际线有多“热”？","desc":"闪闪发光的玻璃摩天大楼正用价值百万美元的景观和现代化的理念改造城市，但气候变化使得为这些建筑降温变得棘手且成本高昂。是时候重新思考城市天际线了吗？<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/30/multimedia/30int-theworld-glass-skyscrapers-01-cwqz-promo/30int-theworld-glass-skyscrapers-01-cwqz-promo-articleLarge.jpg' alt=' Ulet Ifansasti for The New York Times'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Ulet Ifansasti for The New York Times</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'></p>","author":null,"time":"2026-10-30 01:26","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/climate/20261030/glass-skyscrapers-heat-climate-change/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/climate/20261030/glass-skyscrapers-heat-climate-change/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261030/china-ai-videos-sun-wukong-lin-daiyu/","title":"孙悟空爱上林黛玉：中国AI短剧怎么成了“不当婚恋”","desc":"中国政府要求清理“扭曲”原著、颠覆角色设定的AI魔改视频。分析认为政府要求人们以尊崇的态度诠释经典作品，重新诠释历史、神话和经典仍受“意识形态正确性”的约束。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/29/multimedia/29int-china-ai-drama-fpmb/29int-china-ai-drama-fpmb-articleLarge.jpg' alt='一段人工智能生成视频的画面截图，画面中的孙悟空和林黛玉分别出自中国古典名著《西游记》和《红楼梦》。这两部作品均于上世纪80年代被改编成电视剧。 '/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'></p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>一段人工智能生成视频的画面截图，画面中的孙悟空和林黛玉分别出自中国古典名著《西游记》和《红楼梦》。这两部作品均于上世纪80年代被改编成电视剧。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-10-30 12:49","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261030/china-ai-videos-sun-wukong-lin-daiyu/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261030/china-ai-videos-sun-wukong-lin-daiyu/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/world/20261030/israel-election-coalition-scenarios/","title":"大选未产生明确获胜者，谁能最终成为以色列总理？","desc":"初步结果显示，没有任何政党赢得议会绝对多数席位，这意味着政党间需要组成联盟。这可能意味着激烈的谈判，或者僵局，而再次选举的可能性也真实存在。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/29/multimedia/c30israel-01/c30israel-articleLarge.png' alt='注：数据更新至美东时间10月29日5时。各党派必须赢得至少3.25%的全国选票才能进入拥有120个席位的以色列议会。来源：以色列中央选举委员会，经以色列公共广播公司转引。 '/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'></p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>注：数据更新至美东时间10月29日5时。各党派必须赢得至少3.25%的全国选票才能进入拥有120个席位的以色列议会。来源：以色列中央选举委员会，经以色列公共广播公司转引。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-10-30 11:18","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/world/20261030/israel-election-coalition-scenarios/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/world/20261030/israel-election-coalition-scenarios/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/world/20261030/flavio-bolsonaro-trump-brazil-us/","title":"特朗普帮助博索纳罗逃离巴西前往美国","desc":"博索纳罗目前以特朗普下令授予的临时身份滞留佛罗里达，并有望获得永久居留权。白宫对博索纳罗的援助可能加剧美国与巴西的紧张关系，巴西总统卢拉指责特朗普干涉内政。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/29/multimedia/29brazil-bolsonaro-flight-khcf/29brazil-bolsonaro-flight-khcf-articleLarge.jpg' alt='弗拉维奥·博索纳罗周三抵达迈阿密附近的奥帕洛卡机场。 Ricardo Arduengo/Agence France-Presse — Getty Images'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Ricardo Arduengo/Agence France-Presse — Getty Images</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>弗拉维奥·博索纳罗周三抵达迈阿密附近的奥帕洛卡机场。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-10-30 10:21","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/world/20261030/flavio-bolsonaro-trump-brazil-us/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/world/20261030/flavio-bolsonaro-trump-brazil-us/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261030/china-communist-party-purges/","title":"习近平清洗行动继续：中共宣布33名高官被开除党籍","desc":"此次被公告开除党籍的很多官员此前已消失数月甚至更长时间，官方一直没有作出解释。其中包括前高级外事官员刘建超，以及曾担任习近平军方秘书的钟绍军。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/29/multimedia/29int-china-purges-01-jlqz/29int-china-purges-01-jlqz-articleLarge.jpg' alt='中国领导人习近平，上月摄于北京。中国共产党将于2027年召开下一次全国代表大会，届时习近平预计将谋求第四个为期五年的中共中央总书记任期。 Florence Lo/Reuters'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Florence Lo/Reuters</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>中国领导人习近平，上月摄于北京。中国共产党将于2027年召开下一次全国代表大会，届时习近平预计将谋求第四个为期五年的中共中央总书记任期。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-10-30 09:06","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261030/china-communist-party-purges/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/china/20261030/china-communist-party-purges/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261030/nvidia-china-jensen-huang-trump/","title":"黄仁勋被认为是中国间谍行动的目标","desc":"美国情报机构发现，一名与黄仁勋建立了密切联系的中国籍高管是一名向北京传递信息的情报人员。特朗普约一年前听取了相关情报，但他选择不采取任何行动。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/28/multimedia/00dc-chips-01-zhpm/00dc-chips-01-zhpm-videoLarge.jpg' alt='英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋对白宫的技术政策颇具影响力，并与特朗普总统建立了密切关系。 Manuel Orbegozo for The New York Times'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Manuel Orbegozo for The New York Times</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋对白宫的技术政策颇具影响力，并与特朗普总统建立了密切关系。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-10-30 08:42","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261030/nvidia-china-jensen-huang-trump/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261030/nvidia-china-jensen-huang-trump/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/world/20261029/israel-election-vote-results-takeaways/","title":"一场“无人获胜”的选举：以色列大选的四个初步结论","desc":"内塔尼亚胡的执政联盟议席大幅缩水，但其主要对手埃森科特也未能实现目标。阿拉伯裔公民的投票人数创历史新高。新政府最终如何组建可能还需要数周时间才能明朗。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/29/multimedia/c29israel/c29israel-articleLarge.jpg' alt='左：前以色列国防军总参谋长埃森科特；右：以色列总理内塔尼亚胡 Amir Cohen/Reuters; Alexi J. Rosenfeld/Getty Images'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Amir Cohen/Reuters; Alexi J. Rosenfeld/Getty Images</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>左：前以色列国防军总参谋长埃森科特；右：以色列总理内塔尼亚胡</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-10-30 07:30","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/world/20261029/israel-election-vote-results-takeaways/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/world/20261029/israel-election-vote-results-takeaways/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/style/20261029/cheesecake-factory-obama-trump-midterm-elections/","title":"奥巴马特朗普“口水战”中的芝乐坊","desc":"奥巴马嘲笑特朗普对白宫的装修像是“侯赛因开了一家芝乐坊”，白宫则谴责奥巴马是精英主义者。这家以巴洛克式装饰和海量菜单闻名的连锁餐厅成为了新的文化战争的焦点。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/28/multimedia/28FD-cheesecake-factory1-jgmh/28FD-cheesecake-factory1-jgmh-articleLarge.jpg' alt='芝乐坊定义了“高档休闲餐饮”，精准把握了美国食客的心理与胃口。 Timothy Hiatt/Getty Images for The Cheesecake Factory'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Timothy Hiatt/Getty Images for The Cheesecake Factory</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>芝乐坊定义了“高档休闲餐饮”，精准把握了美国食客的心理与胃口。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-10-29 01:57","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/style/20261029/cheesecake-factory-obama-trump-midterm-elections/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/style/20261029/cheesecake-factory-obama-trump-midterm-elections/?utm_source=RSS"},{"id":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261029/trump-midterms-white-house-mood/","title":"人员动荡、派系对立：中期选举前的白宫阴霾密布","desc":"特朗普正在收紧核心圈子，猛烈抨击批评者，坚持亲自主持竞选集会。白宫因人事变动和对选情的焦虑弥漫着阴郁的气氛，人们担心共和党失去两院后局势将如何发展。<p><img src='https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/28/multimedia/28dc-trump-midterms-top-vpqj/28dc-trump-midterms-top-vpqj-articleLarge.jpg' alt='周一，特朗普总统在密西西比州参加完一场竞选集会后。 Doug Mills/The New York Times'/></p>                    <p style='text-align: right; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>Doug Mills/The New York Times</p>                    <p style='text-align: left; color: gray; font-size: 11px!important; line-height: 10px;'>周一，特朗普总统在密西西比州参加完一场竞选集会后。</p>","author":null,"time":"2026-10-29 01:28","url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261029/trump-midterms-white-house-mood/?utm_source=RSS","mobile_url":"https://cn.nytimes.com/usa/20261029/trump-midterms-white-house-mood/?utm_source=RSS"}]}